        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "DHW · Schedule & top-ups",
              "icon": "mdi:water-boiler-auto"
            },
            {
              "type": "entities",
              "show_header_toggle": false,
              "entities": [
                {
                  "entity": "input_boolean.bsb_dhw_calendar_enabled",
                  "name": "Enable DHW calendar"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "input_boolean.bsb_dhw_topup_enabled",
                  "name": "Hourly five-minute top-ups"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "input_number.bsb_dhw_calendar_target",
                  "name": "Hot-water target"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.bsb_lan_00_37_diagnostics_consumer_8830_dhw_temperature_actual_value_top_b3",
                  "name": "Measured hot water"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "select.bsb_lan_00_13_dhw_1600_operating_mode",
                  "name": "Actual DHW mode"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "{{ states('input_text.bsb_dhw_calendar_status') }}\n\n**Hourly top-ups**\n{% if not is_state('input_boolean.bsb_dhw_calendar_enabled', 'on') %}\nPaused with the DHW calendar.\n{% elif not is_state('input_boolean.bsb_dhw_topup_enabled', 'on') %}\nDisabled. Main charging periods still apply.\n{% else %}\n{{ states('input_text.bsb_dhw_topup_status') if states('input_text.bsb_dhw_topup_status') not in ['', 'unknown', 'unavailable'] else 'Waiting for the next full-hour check.' }}\n{% endif %}\n\nChecks at every full hour, including overnight. Outside main periods, starts only below **{{ (states('input_number.bsb_dhw_calendar_target') | float(45) - 2) | round(0) }}°C**. Stops at the target or after **five minutes**, then waits until the next hour. A missing temperature reading blocks the top-up. **Check top-up now** uses the same limit of one attempt per hour.\n\n**Daily main charging periods**\n- **06:00–07:30** · Preheat for 07:00.\n- **16:00–18:00** · Afternoon hot water.\n\nMain periods take priority. Outside them, DHW is Off except during an active top-up. The measured DHW sensor controls the target; the room-heating return cutoff is separate.\n\n**Pause & stop DHW** pauses both schedules and confirms Off before manual control. Restart cancels interrupted top-ups. Timed stops need Home Assistant and its connection; the boiler may continue room heating or pump overrun.\n\nThe heating buffer and stored tap water are different. Confirm the system's hot-water hygiene settings; a 45°C target alone does not provide Legionella control.\n\n**Luna Platinum+: Eco mode is not used.**\n[Edit DHW heating events](/calendar)"
            },
            {
              "type": "button",
              "name": "Pause & stop DHW",
              "icon": "mdi:stop-circle-outline",
              "entity": "script.bsb_dhw_calendar_stop",
              "show_state": false,
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "perform-action",
                "perform_action": "script.bsb_dhw_calendar_stop"
              },
              "hold_action": {
                "action": "none"
              }
            },
