              "name": "Boiler error",
              "icon": "mdi:alert-circle-outline",
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "more-info"
              },
              "icon_tap_action": {
                "action": "more-info"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "Start pauses the calendar and runs a single circuit-1 water cycle. With override enabled, the thermostat contact is still monitored; its interpretation temporarily maintains a heat request. Its thermostat role remains configured. Stop restores owned settings and ends circuit 1 in **Protection mode**.\n\nA boiler error, lost feedback or the maximum duration stops the cycle and pauses the schedule. The return-water cutoff requires Home Assistant and its connection. DHW runs independently."
            }
          ]
